WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Welcome to Cradle to Legacy. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.800
Jr. I want entrepreneurship to create practical opportunity

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.040
now and give you a way to think

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.440
about what you are building over time. In

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.840
this course, we move from a tested offer

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:18.080
toward repeatable delivery, clearer money records, responsible growth

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.880
and continuity. You will connect the enterprise to

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.200
the life you want, map how work gets

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.560
done, look at cash and capacity together, and

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.680
design one bounded growth test. Then we will

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.560
ask what should continue if you are unavailable

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:34.720
and what you want the enterprise to contribute

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.760
beyond the next sale. This is education and

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.960
planning. It does not promise income, wealth or

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.520
a business that someone can inherit. Your work

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.480
will be grounded in records, honest assumptions and

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.360
the advice your situation needs. Start with your

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.400
purpose and the evidence of the stage you

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.160
are in today.
